{"meta":{"ui":"order_summary","model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"generate","prompt":"Show my grocery order as an inline card before you place it, with the number of items at the top. Five lines, each with a picture placeholder, its price and a quantity I can raise or lower (removing the line at zero): Bananas 1 kg $2.50 x1, Whole milk 2 L $3.20 x2, Sourdough loaf $4.50 x1, Free-range eggs $5.00 x1, Cheddar $7.00 x1. A promo code field where SAVE10 takes 10% off the subtotal, delivery of $4.99, and the subtotal, promo and total kept up to date as I change things. Confirm and cancel buttons that tell you what I decided.","text":"ChatCard \"Your grocery order\" \"{count(items,i=>i.qty>0)} items\" icon:\"shopping_basket\" status:\"Review\" tone:accent w:390\n  state items=[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Bananas\",\"detail\":\"1 kg\",\"price\":2.5,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"banana\",\"tone\":\"sand\"},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Whole milk\",\"detail\":\"2 L\",\"price\":3.2,\"qty\":2,\"kind\":\"milk\",\"tone\":\"sky\"},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Sourdough loaf\",\"detail\":\"Fresh baked\",\"price\":4.5,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"bread\",\"tone\":\"sand\"},{\"id\":4,\"name\":\"Free-range eggs\",\"detail\":\"Dozen\",\"price\":5.0,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"eggs\",\"tone\":\"rose\"},{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"Cheddar\",\"detail\":\"Mature\",\"price\":7.0,\"qty\":1,\"kind\":\"cheese\",\"tone\":\"sand\"}]\n  state code=\"\"\n  state decision=\"\"\n  if decision==\"\"\n    SectionLabel \"Items\" \"{sum(items,i=>i.qty)} total units\"\n    each i in items\n      CartLine \"{i.name}\" \"{i.detail}\" price:=money(i.price,\"$\",2) qty:=i.qty kind:=i.kind tone:=i.tone -> items=removeWhere(updateWhere(items,x=>x.id==i.id,x=>with(x,\"qty\",result)),x=>x.qty<=0)\n    InputField \"Promo code\" \"Try SAVE10\" =code success:=upper(trim(code))==\"SAVE10\"?\"SAVE10 applied: 10% off\":\"\"\n    Details rows:=[[\"Subtotal\",money(sum(items,i=>i.price*i.qty),\"$\",2)],[\"Promo\",upper(trim(code))==\"SAVE10\"?\"-\"+money(sum(items,i=>i.price*i.qty)*0.1,\"$\",2):\"$0.00\"],[\"Delivery\",\"$4.99\"]]\n    TotalBar \"Total\" \"{sum(items,i=>i.qty)} units, delivery included\" amount:=money(sum(items,i=>i.price*i.qty)*(upper(trim(code))==\"SAVE10\"?0.9:1)+4.99,\"$\",2) cta:\"Confirm\" enabled:=length(items)>0 -> decision=\"confirmed\"; emit confirm\n    ActionButton \"Cancel\" tone:quiet -> decision=\"cancelled\"; emit cancel\n  if decision==\"confirmed\"\n    Receipt \"Order confirmed\" \"Your groceries are on their way.\" tone:good\n  if decision==\"cancelled\"\n    Receipt \"Order cancelled\" \"Nothing was placed.\" tone:neutral","usage":{"input_tokens":9140,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":927,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":755,"totalMs":5346}}
